+
+## Schema 3: API keys and audit
+
+Schema 3 adds `apiKeys` (`{ key, name, role }`, with roles `viewer`, `cook`,
+`manager`) and `audit` (`{ time, name, method, path, status }`). Migration from
+schema 2 preserves existing fields and initializes missing collections to empty
+arrays; it does not grant access by creating keys. Audit entries are appended
+with each successful data-changing HTTP request and saved with its changes.
+`GET /audit` returns entries newest first, with later entries first on ties.
